# NAME: Apple Lite
# AUTHOR: JovanyKoch
# UPDATED: 2026-06-03
# TYPE: Surge Ruleset
# DESC: Apple's lightweight rule set adapted to the scenario of returning to China. Only domestic access/low-latency commonly used services are retained, and overseas services such as Apple TV/iCloud Private Relay are not included.
# NOTE: The rule set is not bound to a policy. Please specify the policy through RULE-SET in the main configuration.
